<section image-layout="blank" id="QUsfx6IuRy"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="SIZ6XJ6kI-" background-color="accent" padding="28pt 12pt 24pt" colspan="7"><p role="eyebrow">Field guide</p><spacer mode="fill"></spacer><p role="caption">SCOPE</p><p role="caption">03 / 10</p></grid-item><grid-item id="XIOIPwPnxs" padding="24pt 30pt 22pt 28pt" colspan="53"><labels><label variant="outline">Illustrative replacement · validate before use</label></labels><h2 font-size="28pt">Scope closes only when evidence closes it</h2><p font-size="16pt">Four deliverables replace a general promise to “improve support.” Each has an explicit acceptance test, boundary, and dependency set.</p><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="fill"><grid-item colspan="38"><table col-widths="[18,42]" borders="rows" striped="false"><tr><th>Deliverable</th><th>Acceptance evidence</th></tr><tr><td><p font-size="16pt"><b>Unified intake</b></p></td><td><p font-size="16pt">Required fields, consent, duplicate checks, and acknowledgement behavior pass for email, chat, and web.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="16pt"><b>Routing configuration</b></p></td><td><p font-size="16pt">Representative scenarios validate eight categories, priority rules, queue ownership, and supervisor overrides.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="16pt"><b>Operational enablement</b></p></td><td><p font-size="16pt">Designated supervisors complete launch, escalation, and rollback rehearsal using the runbook.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="16pt"><b>Reporting</b></p></td><td><p font-size="16pt">Queue health, routing accuracy, backlog age, and overrides meet refresh and reconciliation thresholds.</p></td></tr></table></grid-item><grid-item colspan="22"><grid direction="vertical" spacing="small" vertical-sizing="fill"><grid-item cell-style="subtle"><p role="eyebrow">Outside scope</p><h4>Keep the boundary explicit</h4><p font-size="16pt">CRM replacement · workforce planning · cleanup beyond 90 days · customer-facing policy changes.</p></grid-item><grid-item cell-style="subtle"><p role="eyebrow">Dependencies</p><h4>Confirm before acceptance</h4><p font-size="16pt">Identity roles · API access · analytics export capacity · approved categories · supervisor availability · release authority.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>